      "content": "# Cloud Platform Connectors\n\nAutomate cloud resource discovery via read-only cloud APIs:\n\n- **Amazon Web Services (AWS)**: Discover EC2, RDS, Lambda, S3, and ingest AWS Cost Explorer data.\n- **Microsoft Azure**: Inventory VMs, App Services, SQL Databases, and Azure Resource Graph entries.\n- **Google Cloud Platform (GCP)**: Enumerate Compute Engine, GKE clusters, and Cloud SQL instances.\n"
