      "depth": 2,
      "content": "# Standard Reports\n\nOut-of-the-box standard reports ready for immediate use:\n\n- **Application Catalog Summary**: Complete list of systems, owners, and costs.\n- **Software License Compliance Report**: Over-licensed vs. under-licensed position.\n- **Ghost Asset Reconciliation**: Discrepancies between purchase orders and network telemetry.\n- **24-Month EOL Exposure Report**: Hardware and software approaching end of support.\n"
