                "content": "# User Management\n\nManage enterprise users and role assignments:\n\n- **Invite Users**: Send invitation emails with 72-hour secure activation tokens.\n- **Role Assignment**: Assign Super Admin, Platform Admin, Contributor, or Viewer roles.\n- **Deactivation**: Instantly revoke system access while preserving data audit history.\n- **Group Policies**: Map IdP security groups directly to NuVision permissions.\n"
