                "content": "# Setting Up a Connector\n\nFollow these steps to activate a connector:\n\n1. Navigate to **Settings \u2192 Integrations \u2192 Connector Library**.\n2. Select the target integration tile and click **Configure**.\n3. Provide authentication credentials (API Key, OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials, or Service Account).\n4. Define sync cadence (Real-time webhook, Hourly, or Daily scheduled sweep).\n5. Map external fields to NuVision entities using the drag-and-drop field mapper.\n6. Click **Test Connection** to verify, then click **Activate**.\n"
