                "content": "# Getting Started\n\nWelcome to the NuVision onboarding guide. This section walks you through prerequisites, account activation, first login, and understanding default user roles.\n\n### Quick Start Checklist\n\n- [ ] Obtain your tenant URL (e.g., `https://yourorg.nuvision.pemvish.com`)\n- [ ] Check inbox for account activation invitation (valid for 72 hours)\n- [ ] Set up Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) via TOTP app\n- [ ] Complete the interactive Onboarding Wizard on initial sign-in\n"
