                "content": "# Vendor Register\n\nMaintain a single profile for each technology partner:\n\n- **Vendor Details**: Company name, account executives, escalation contacts, support tiers.\n- **Strategic Tiering**: Tier 1 (Critical), Tier 2 (Preferred), Tier 3 (Commodity).\n- **Compliance & Security**: SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR, and insurance certificates with expiration tracking.\n- **Associated Assets**: Instant reverse lookup of all applications and hardware provided by the vendor.\n"
