        "content": "# NuVision User Manual\n\nWelcome to the **PEMVISH NuVision User Manual**. NuVision is a unified command centre combining Enterprise Architecture Management (EAM), Application Portfolio Management (APM), IT Asset Management (ITAM), Technology Risk & Obsolescence Management, and Business Portfolio Governance into a single, configuration-driven SaaS platform.\n\n## About PEMVISH LLC\n\nFounded in 2022 and headquartered in Princeton, New Jersey, **PEMVISH LLC** builds modern, configuration-driven enterprise technology governance solutions. Our flagship platform, **NuVision**, is a SOC 2 Type II compliant serverless SaaS platform that helps mid-to-large enterprises streamline operations, reduce software complexity, and maintain technology governance without requiring extensive custom code.\n\n## Documentation Structure\n\n- **[Introduction](introduction/platform-overview/README.md)**: Platform overview, design principles, architecture, and getting started.\n- **[Modules](modules/enterprise-architecture/README.md)**: Deep dive into EAM, APM, ITAM, SAM, HAM, Risk Management, Business Portfolio, and Vendor Management.\n- **[Configuration & Administration](configuration/integrations/README.md)**: Zero-code integrations, user management, SSO, audit logging, and custom reports.\n- **[Help & Reference](help/support-and-troubleshooting/README.md)**: Support SLAs, troubleshooting guides, release notes, and comprehensive glossary.\n\nSelect any section from the left navigation panel to read and update each topic individually.\n"
